      "title": "👑 Pixaroma - Note - START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n### Models are downloaded automatically the first time you use the workflow.\n \n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- ComfyUI-Easy-Use\n- Qwen3-TTS - Voice Synthesis & Cloning\n- ComfyUI_LayerStyle\n\n\nRead More about Qwen TTS Node [HERE](https://github.com/flybirdxx/ComfyUI-Qwen-TTS)\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\n---\n\n## 🎙️ Qwen3 CustomVoice Preset Workflow\n\n### What it does\n- Turns **Speech Text** into speech using a **preset speaker** (example: Ryan)\n- Optional **Voice Direction** controls delivery (tone, pace, emotion)\n- Saves an MP3 automatically\n\n### How to use\n1. **Speech Text**: type what you want spoken\n2. **Speaker**: choose a preset voice (Ryan, Eric, Vivian, etc.)\n3. **Voice Direction (Optional)**: describe how it should sound\n4. Click **Run**\n\n### Save location\n- Preview inside **Save Audio (MP3)**\n- Saves to: **ComfyUI\\\\output\\\\audio**"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
